 *  ```
 *     cn-hangzhou (Hangzhou): cn-hangzhou-h, cn-hangzhou-j, cn-hangzhou-k
 *     cn-shanghai (Shanghai): cn-shanghai-e, cn-shanghai-f, cn-shanghai-l
